":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"constructors","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Constructors"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"constructor","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Constructor"}]},{"type":"code","value":"new TanStackTable<TFeatures, TData>(): TanStackTable<TFeatures, TData>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackTable"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"table","children":[{"type":"text","value":"table"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly table: InputSignal<AngularTable<TFeatures, TData>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts#L68","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts:68"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The current TanStack Table instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provided as a required signal input so DI consumers always read the latest value."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"class-tanstacktabletfeatures-tdata","text":"Class: TanStackTable<TFeatures, TData>","level":1},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"table","text":"table","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Class: TanStackTable\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts:59](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts#L59)\n\nProvides a TanStack Table instance (`AngularTable`) in Angular DI.\n\nThe table can be injected by:\n- any descendant of an element using `[tanStackTable]=\"...\"`\n- any component instantiated by `*flexRender` when the render props contains `table`\n\n## Example\n\n```html\n<div [tanStackTable]=\"table\">\n  <app-pagination />\n</div>\n```\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-pagination',\n  template: `\n    <button (click)=\"prev()\" [disabled]=\"!table().getCanPreviousPage()\">Prev</button>\n    <button (click)=\"next()\" [disabled]=\"!table().getCanNextPage()\">Next</button>\n  `,\n})\nexport class PaginationComponent {\n  readonly table = injectTableContext()\n\n  prev() {\n    this.table().previousPage()\n  }\n  next() {\n    this.table().nextPage()\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew TanStackTable<TFeatures, TData>(): TanStackTable<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TanStackTable`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### table\n\n```ts\nreadonly table: InputSignal<AngularTable<TFeatures, TData>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts:68](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts#L68)\n\nThe current TanStack Table instance.\n\nProvided as a required signal input so DI consumers always read the latest value.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TanStackTable\ntitle: TanStackTable\n---\n\n# Class: TanStackTable\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts:59](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts#L59)\n\nProvides a TanStack Table instance (`AngularTable`) in Angular DI.\n\nThe table can be injected by:\n- any descendant of an element using `[tanStackTable]=\"...\"`\n- any component instantiated by `*flexRender` when the render props contains `table`\n\n## Example\n\n```html\n<div [tanStackTable]=\"table\">\n  <app-pagination />\n</div>\n```\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-pagination',\n  template: `\n    <button (click)=\"prev()\" [disabled]=\"!table().getCanPreviousPage()\">Prev</button>\n    <button (click)=\"next()\" [disabled]=\"!table().getCanNextPage()\">Next</button>\n  `,\n})\nexport class PaginationComponent {\n  readonly table = injectTableContext()\n\n  prev() {\n    this.table().previousPage()\n  }\n  next() {\n    this.table().nextPage()\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew TanStackTable<TFeatures, TData>(): TanStackTable<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TanStackTable`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### table\n\n```ts\nreadonly table: InputSignal<AngularTable<TFeatures, TData>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts:68](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/angular-table/src/helpers/table.ts#L68)\n\nThe current TanStack Table instance.\n\nProvided as a required signal input so DI consumers always read the latest value.\n"}
